--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2] model_tflite.cpp — TFLite Model Data (Training Dataset: MNIST)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The int8-quantized model embedded in src/tinyml_main/model_tflite.cpp was
trained on the MNIST database of handwritten digits (0-9).

    Authors: Yann LeCun (Courant Institute, NYU) and Corinna Cortes
             (Google Labs), with Christopher J.C. Burges. Derived from NIST
             Special Databases SD-1 and SD-3.
    Source:  http://yann.lecun.com/exdb/mnist/

The embedded binary is a derivative work of the dataset.

License note: The MNIST authors do not state an explicit license on the
canonical distribution page. MNIST is widely redistributed for research and
commercial machine-learning use; some redistributions apply the Creative
Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 (CC-BY-SA-3.0) terms. The attribution above
is retained accordingly. Confirm the applicable terms with your legal team
before commercial redistribution.
